{"id":"bf3842b8de0e119c","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-model5-definable-set.md","title":"ZFC Model5 Definable Set","display":"df-zfc-model5-definable-set — ZFC Model5 Definable Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model5-definable-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model5-definable-set"],"display":"df-zfc-model5-definable-set — ZFC Model5 Definable Set","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-satisfaction]]","[[58-df-structure]]","[[58-df-assignment]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-finite]]","[[58-df-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model5-definable-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model5-definable-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model5-definable-set — ZFC Model5 Definable Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"58-df-satisfaction\">58-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"58-df-assignment\">58-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"58-df-finite\">58-df-finite</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> (first-order language) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> (candidate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-structure)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Univ}(M)\">\\(\\operatorname{Univ}(M)\\)</span> (universe of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\operatorname{Univ}(M)\">\\(A\\subseteq\\operatorname{Univ}(M)\\)</span> (parameter set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq\\operatorname{Univ}(M)\">\\(D\\subseteq\\operatorname{Univ}(M)\\)</span> (definable subset)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L\\)</span> (formula)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_S\\setminus\\{v_0\\}\">\\(J\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_S\\setminus\\{v_0\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:J\\to A\">\\(p:J\\to A\\)</span> (finite parameter support and parameter assignment)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\operatorname{Univ}(M)\">\\(x\\in\\operatorname{Univ}(M)\\)</span> (element bound in the assertion)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span> (structure predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S,\\mathrm{Var}_S,\\mathrm{Assign},\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S,\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S,\\mathrm{Var}_S,\\mathrm{Assign},\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S,\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> (syntax, assignment, semantic, function, and finiteness symbols)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\">\\(\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\)</span> (semantic maps)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel5DefinableSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel5DefinableSet}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model5\\text{-}definable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel5DefinableSet}_S(M,A,D,L)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\operatorname{Univ}(M)\\land D\\subseteq\\operatorname{Univ}(M)\\land\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},\\varphi,J,p\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\land v_0\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land J\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_S\\setminus\\{v_0\\}\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(J)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(p,J,A)\\land D=\\{x\\in\\operatorname{Univ}(M):\\forall s\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var}_S\\times\\operatorname{Univ}(M))\\;((\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s)\\land p\\subseteq s)\\to\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s[v_0\\mapsto x]))\\}\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model5\\text{-}definable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel5DefinableSet}_S(M,A,D,L)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\operatorname{Univ}(M)\\land D\\subseteq\\operatorname{Univ}(M)\\land\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},\\varphi,J,p\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\land v_0\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land J\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_S\\setminus\\{v_0\\}\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(J)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(p,J,A)\\land D=\\{x\\in\\operatorname{Univ}(M):\\forall s\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var}_S\\times\\operatorname{Univ}(M))\\;((\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s)\\land p\\subseteq s)\\to\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s[v_0\\mapsto x]))\\}\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Parameters are carried by a finite partial assignment into <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>.  Universal closure over its total extensions avoids an unsourced free-variable operator and, when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J=\\varnothing\">\\(J=\\varnothing\\)</span>, correctly retains parameter-free definitions even if <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\varnothing\">\\(A=\\varnothing\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-finite]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"re